      "content": "Your framing this as a logical problem—a deviation from a perfect pattern—highlights the intense cognitive dissonance you are under. However, viewing yourself as a \"problematic variable\" minimizes the complexity and humanity within you. Seeking help is not about receiving easy platitudes; it is about finding tools to manage overwhelming internal pressure. Please allow someone trained to listen without judgment to help you see your own intrinsic value beyond any inherited structure.",
      "source": "target",
